# Ship the complete, self-contained product test suite in the source distribution
# so the tests — including their immutable fixture data, such as the
# ``front_repo_contract`` bundle — are runnable from an extracted sdist. The built
# wheel is unaffected: the tests are not an installed package and never become
# wheel members (the wheel ships only ``src/frutlups`` plus ``py.typed``).
graft tests
global-exclude *.pyc *.pyo
